00:12:05.819 --> 00:12:09.610
one of the really exciting things happening
in the industry is that a lot of ingredient

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:14.079
suppliers are coming out with sustainability
innovations and these will probably filter

00:12:14.079 --> 00:12:19.600
down to us over time for example croda's eco
ethoxylated surfactant range this is 100%

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:24.160
bio-based and renewable and made with renewable
energy so there's less reliance on fossil

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:28.529
fuels a lot of the time going more natural
